          {
            "title": "Using Alias",
            "id": 113107,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Sekarang kita sudah menggabungkan tabel `artist` dan `artwork` dengan cara yang memberi pemilik galeri gambaran yang lebih baik tentang inventaris mereka. Untuk menyempurnakan hasil kita, mari ubah nama beberapa kolom kita.\n\n1. Ganti nama:\n    - `artist.name` menjadi `artist`,\n    - `artwork.title` dari karya seni yang terkait dengan seniman menjadi `title_of_piece`\n    - `artwork.year_created` menjadi `year`\n    - `artwork.type` dari karya seni yang dimiliki menjadi `type_of_artwork`",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": false,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "script.sql",
                  "codeLanguage": "sql",
                  "content": "SELECT artist.name, artwork.title, \r\nartwork.year_created, artwork.type\r\nFROM artist\r\nJOIN artwork\r\nON artist.name = artwork.artist_name;",
                  "solvedContent": "SELECT artist.name AS artist, artwork.title AS title_of_piece, \r\nartwork.year_created AS year, artwork.type AS type_of_artwork\r\nFROM artist\r\nJOIN artwork\r\nON artist.name = artwork.artist_name;"
                }
              ],
              "hints": [
                {
                  "title": "Hint",
                  "content": "1. For this query, remember to use aliasing with `AS` to change names as required."
